  vendor/science-skills/

    Copied verbatim from revision
    0b42509800f49e6eb7809505d96e20a890ef99bd (plugin "science" v1.1.0).
    Upstream ships no NOTICE file of its own, so nothing from one is
    reproduced here; the full license text is retained at
    vendor/science-skills/LICENSE.

    The individual skills reach third-party data sources whose terms are
    separate from this license and not granted by it. Those terms are
    listed per source in vendor/science-skills/SKILL_LICENSES.md, and
    most skills additionally require that the user be notified of them
    before use. The harness writes that notice into each workspace
    (engine/src/co_scientist/platform/sandbox/skills/licences.py), which satisfies the
    condition the skills themselves state but reaches nobody, since the
    workspace is deleted. It therefore also counts the sources each run
    actually queried (engine/src/co_scientist/platform/sandbox/skills/usage.py) and names
    them, with a pointer to their terms, in the run's report.

