Web client dependencies

  The production frontend build bundles third-party npm packages (React,
  React Router, the unified/micromark Markdown stack, highlight.js,
  Sentry and others). Minification removes their licence comments, so
  the build writes third-party-licenses.txt beside the bundle, served at
  /third-party-licenses.txt, with the name, version, licence and full
  licence and notice text of every bundled package. The build fails if a
  bundled package has no licence file or a licence outside the list in
  app/frontend/scripts/third_party_licenses.mjs.
